{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2020-03-30 20:30:00', 'title': 'WALT DISNEY SEES REDUCTIONS IN BASE SALARY AMONG A BROAD GROUP OF ITS EXECUTIVE LEVEL EMPLOYEES', 'text': "WALT DISNEY CO - EFFECTING REDUCTIONS IN BASE SALARY AMONG A BROAD GROUP OF ITS EXECUTIVE LEVEL EMPLOYEES.WALT DISNEY - EACH OF NAMED EXECUTIVE OFFICERS AGREED BY IRREVOCABLE WAIVER TO EFFECT A TEMPORARY REDUCTION IN BASE SALARIES.WALT DISNEY CO - IGER HAS AGREED TO FORGO, THROUGH LAST PAYROLL PERIOD IN COMPANY'S CURRENT FISCAL YEAR.WALT DISNEY CO -  BOB CHAPEK TO FOREGO RECEIPT OF 50% OF THE BASE SALARY.WALT DISNEY CO - EXCEPT FOR AMOUNT OF COMPENSATION FOR PAID TIME OFF, REDUCTIONS ARE NOT INTENDED TO REDUCE ANY COMPANY EMPLOYEE BENEFIT.WALT DISNEY CO - EACH OF BRAVERMAN, MCCARTHY,  PARKER AND MUCHA WILL FOREGO RECEIPT OF 30% OF THE BASE SALARY."}